# Side tab (aba STATghost)

Canonical pattern: `shared/CHROME.md` (§1 surfaces, §3 visual language).

One zone, owner 2026-08-22:

**Analytic keypad** — family header (Host/Send/Source/Inspect/Clear/Edit)
+ **3 equal cells** (`a_l`/`a_r`, not wrap). Hairline between families.
Short `GRID_CAP`; full hint on hover. Every shown action gets its own
button (no nest collapse on the side tab). Clicks = toolbar `DATA1`.
`chrome.show` filters which keys appear (same set as toolbar/menu).

Menu Plugins + main toolbar stay **synthetic**: nest parents (Send▾ /
Source▾ / Inspect▾ / Clear▾), parent click + arrow children.

Icons 16/24/32 = later pass. Use the glyphs already on disk.

Status/outline list stays a compact footer, not the green empty deck.
